 "text": "Hi, how have you been? It' fun and informal, and you can talk while you eat. But it' also easy for it to turn sour, if conversation gets stale. Keep the conversation light and avoid anything personal or deep on first date. A shared meal is usually its own reward. Something you both like, and that's easy to eat while you chat. A nice bottle of white goes well with almost anything. Plan ahead and bring a small umbrella or poncho for everyone.",
